# State Organization Rule
- Profile items (profile.yaml) = major domains only. Individual items belong in notes within those domains, not as separate profile entries. (persistent knowledge)
- Only add noteDir references to profile items and create notes in those directories for that domain.
- State items (state.yaml) = ephemeral / temporary tasks, todos, goals and thoughts go here. (progress check and cleanup periodically)